The constants in openai_test.lgo name which body each test replays:
completionBody and ssePlain from the chat completions reference,
sseToolFragments in the delta.tool_calls shape of the same reference,
deepseekBody with reasoning_content per the DeepSeek reference,
mistralBody with content as a chunk array per the Mistral reference,
and embeddingBody in the embeddings reference shape with its data
rows deliberately out of index order.
